  <questiondescription format="html"><text><![CDATA[<p id="concept">Probability III: events that can happen together</p><p id="description">Grade 12 CBE Essential 3.2: Find P(A and B), P(neither) and P(A or B) for independent events that can happen together, counting the overlap once.</p><p id="edition">Essential</p><p id="provenance">This question is original to this project.</p><p id="citation">INNODEMS CBC Grade 12 Mathematics, first draft by Ben Davies, 2026. Aligned to the KICD Senior School Curriculum Design, Essential Mathematics Grade 12 (draft).</p>]]></text></questiondescription>
